# U49 c: Items view with allflame_exp_048, compact mode: the slot rows (drawCompactSlotRow: the
# label, both item boxes with fitted names, the diff labels, the Buy/Copy/Equip buttons; the
# abyssal sockets of either build), the tree set dropdowns DrawItems positions and fills, the
# jewel rows (warnings, the underlined socket labels), itemsColWidth and the horizontal scroll
# bar (the content is wider than 1280). At 1600/1920 the Equip buttons are on screen:
# hovering Weapon 2's (the stat comparison tooltip: getMiscCalculator, calcFunc with repSlotName /
# repItem, AddStatComparesToTooltip; 1920: an Equip click equips it, T4). Hovering the primary Weapon 1 box (U38's item tooltip
# with its stat differences), the Copy button (hover fill), a Copy click
# (CopyCompareItemToPrimary: the item is added to the primary build; T4), wheel scrolling, then expanded mode (DrawItemExpanded: the measure
# pass, both item cards with the diff markers, the column divider).
#! u49-import allflame_exp_048.xml
#! u49-expect-text ^7-- Jewels --
#! u49-expect-text ^7Copy
#! u49-expect-text Expanded mode
#! u49-expect-text ^7Equipping this item in Weapon 2 will give you:
screen 1600 900 dpi 1
fixture userdir=../u46/user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 98
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 580 138
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 500 250
frames 1
move 1260 250
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot copied
move 1336 270
frames 1
move 700 500
frames 1
move 700 500
wheel down 2
frames 2
wheel up 2
frames 2
move 437 175
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 700 500
wheel down 3
frames 2
